From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 18:22:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(games): add Drikke tab with an iBeer-style virtual beer

The screen is the glass: the beer surface stays level as the phone turns,
tipping past the rim angle pours it out with glug haptics, shaking builds
foam, and an empty glass can be refilled. Uses only expo-sensors, which is
already in the installed binaries, so it ships over the air.

